格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH Web GUI 桌面宠物插件（QQ 宠物形态）：右下角悬浮、可拖拽/投喂/玩耍的积累型伙伴。","id":"gh:1329947687","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"whale-girl","slug":"vlln/whale-girl","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-repository-plugin","pet"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH Web GUI 桌面宠物插件（QQ 宠物形态）：右下角悬浮、可拖拽/投喂/玩耍的积累型伙伴。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"中文 | English"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"whale-girl"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A desktop pet in the DSH Web GUI (QQ-pet style)"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"A persistent companion floating bottom-right: draggable, feedable, playable —\ncompleted tasks, sessi"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ons, and companionship time accrue into seniority levels,\ntitles, and memories."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Official **bundle plugin** (`dsh.bundle` + `dsh.client` in root `package.json`), managed via the off"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"dle plugin** (`dsh.bundle` + `dsh.client` in root `package.json`), managed via the official profile:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**Restart web** after installing (bundle layers compose at startup); the pet appears bottom-right: c"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"lick for its menu (🍗 feed / 🎾 play), drag to move, hover for the status bar (seniority level / task "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"count / recent shared memories). Hidden on onboarding pages."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Update via `dsh plugin --profile web update whale-girl` (or switch the git ref), then restart."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| You / event | Pet behavior |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Drag the pet | Stretched diagonally (`drag`) |\n| Menu 🍗 feed / 🎾 play | Chomping / ball toss (`eat"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"`/`play`) → joy (`joy`) |\n| Idle ≥60s | Naps (`sleep`); wakes on interaction (`wake`) |\n| Task done "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"/ level-up / title / round done | Cheers (`celebrate`) |\n| Task failed / request error | Startled (`"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"error`) → disappointed (`disappointed`) |\n| New session | Waves welcome (`welcome`) |\n| Session runn"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"ing / thinking | Pensive company (`think`, occasional `working`) |\n| Awaiting approval | Expectant w"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"aiting (`wait`) |\n| Periodic wandering | Walking (`walk`) |\n| Default | Idle standby (`idle`, random"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"| Periodic wandering | Walking (`walk`) |\n| Default | Idle standby (`idle`, random blinks / turns) |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Full state machine (priorities / transitions / triggers): docs/state-machine.md."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Desktop Companion (Optional)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"`desktop/` is a **standalone companion app** (Node engine + Tauri shell, zero runtime deps) that kee"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ps the whale girl resident on your OS desktop. **Not installed via `dsh plugin`** — enable it yourse"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"the whale girl resident on your OS desktop. **Not installed via `dsh plugin`** — enable it yourself:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Uses whale-girl's public endpoints (`/state`, `/events`, `/presence`, `/interact`, `/config`, `/as"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"sets`) **without touching the plugin**; the in-page pet hides while it runs (presence contract) and "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"returns after exit/crash (TTL 45s).\n- Shell: Tauri v2 (recommended, ~12MB); legacy Electron shell ke"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"pt (`npm i -D electron`).\n- Design & contracts: `desktop/DESIGN.md`, `desktop/BUILD-RUN.md`."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## State Preview"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| State | Trigger | Preview |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| `idle` | Default standby |  |\n| `working` | Random work spell while session thinks |  |\n| `celebra"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"te` | Task done / level-up / title / round done |  |\n| `error` | Task failed / request error |  |\n| "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"`disappointed` | Brief dejection after failure |  |\n| `joy` | Happy after feeding / playing |  |\n| `"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"eat` | Click to feed |  |\n| `play` | Click to play |  |\n| `drag` | While dragging |  |\n| `walk` | Pe"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"riodic wandering |  |\n| `sleep` | Idle ≥60s |  |\n| `wake` | Wake-up transition |  |\n| `welcome` | Ne"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"w session |  |\n| `think` | Company while session thinks |  |\n| `wait` | Awaiting approval |  |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**Plugins → Installed → whale-girl bundle page** (config card): the high-frequency subset — show on "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"page, session memory, size, opacity, wandering, sleep delay, and the feed/play reply pools (one per "},{"id":"p23s3","text":"line). **Session memory** (off by default) records completed-task milestones to a local file and gre"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"ets you with last time's progress on resume/fork — local only, never model context, never uploaded; "},{"id":"p23s5","text":"off stops all reads/writes (file kept). Changes **apply immediately, no restart** (a switch writes o"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"n click; numbers and reply pools write on blur or Enter).\nThe card's first row is an **update row**:"},{"id":"p23s7","text":" it checks the source once on mount (git installs by commit, registry installs by version) and shows"},{"id":"p23s8","text":" the verdict plus the installed short commit; a newer revision turns the button into \"Update to <tar"},{"id":"p23s9","text":"get>…\", and updating reinstalls through DSH's profile package manager without touching your settings"},{"id":"p23s10","text":". Full contract (endpoints, payloads, two-step reinstall, failure reasons, host version requirement)"},{"id":"p23s11","text":": docs/update-row.md."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The full option list lives in the plugin entry's `config` in the profile patch (`<dshHome>/profiles/"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"<profile>/cordis.patch.yml`); a `whale-girl:` section in `<dshHome>/settings.yaml` is imported into "},{"id":"p24s3","text":".patch.yml`); a `whale-girl:` section in `<dshHome>/settings.yaml` is imported into that entry once:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Full option list and why the semantic layer (XP / titles) is sealed: `lib/src/config.mjs`. **Not con"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"figurable** (changing XP / title thresholds would break the accumulation ledger)."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Characters"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"🎭 \"Switch Character\" cycles characters (or set `whale-girl:character` in localStorage); the button i"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"s **greyed out when the manifest has a single character** (\"No other characters available\"). Every c"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"haracter ships **all 15 states** (full contract: docs/sprites-spec.md); new characters: docs/adding-"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"**all 15 states** (full contract: docs/sprites-spec.md); new characters: docs/adding-a-character.md."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Reference Implementation"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"whale-girl is a complete **bundle plugin format** exemplar (`dsh.bundle` + `cordis.patch.yml` + `lib"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"/`, evolving with the official mechanism) — model new plugins on it:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- **Structure**: `lib/` (entry / logic / client / assets) separate from docs, decisions, scripts — r"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"oot AGENTS.md\n- **Conventions**: gates (`scripts/gates/run.mjs`) + decision records + full asset con"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"tracts; guidance: plugin-registry's make-dsh-plugin skill, cookbook, gotchas"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"**Issues and suggestions welcome** — your feedback shapes the pet's next steps:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- 🐛 **Bug**: file an issue with repro steps, browser & dsh versions; console errors for client issue"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"s\n- 💡 **Feature ideas**: see docs/state-machine.md and docs/growth-system.md, describe the expected "},{"id":"p34s3","text":"effect\n- 🎨 **New characters**: docs/adding-a-character.md §quick guide — read-only contract, 15 shee"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"ts + manifest entries, validated by `verify-assets`\n- 🔧 **Code**: every non-trivial change needs a d"},{"id":"p34s5","text":"ecision record (`decisions/`), gate self-checks, single-purpose commits (docs/AGENTS.md, root AGENTS"},{"id":"p34s6","text":"ion record (`decisions/`), gate self-checks, single-purpose commits (docs/AGENTS.md, root AGENTS.md)"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"MIT License"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
